==== Wave 1: Content

Content mods for this wave are the places, not the systems: scenery along the ferry route that makes cross-country flying feel real — airports, landmarks, regions, and anything that adds a reason to fly a particular leg.

Per project rule, this project does not select mods — the cards below are *pending addition* from you, with the fields this guide's rules demand.

